-- RGCB Technical Recruitment 2026: 8 posts (2 Technical Officer, 3 Technical Assistant Group II, 3 Technical Assistant Group I), Advt RGCB/Advt./TECH/01/2026 dated 28 October 2026, portal closes 14 December 2026 5:00 PM, no fee
-- TNPSC Group II and IIA prelims 1 November 2026: 4,89,885 candidates for 846 posts (43 Group II, 803 Group IIA), notification 07/2026 dated 11 August 2026, applications closed 9 September 2026
-- VERIFIED 28 October 2026: Edex Live RGCB report read in full this run (Advt number, 8 posts, category split, pay levels, qualifications, age 35, three-tier selection, 14 December 2026 5:00 PM deadline, no fee, rgcb.res.in); FreeJobAlert RGCB report read in full this run (Indian citizens only, experience must be from government research institutions/PSU/autonomous bodies/universities, provisional numbers, panel valid one year, admit card + ID disqualification); IANS TNPSC report read in full this run (28 October 2026, 4,89,885 candidates, 846 posts, 1,647 centres, Chennai 51,721 across 173 centres, approx. 579 per vacancy, hall tickets already released); DT Next TNPSC report read in full this run (notification 11 August 2026, applications until 9 September 2026, 43 + 803 split, forenoon session 1 November 2026, OTR dashboard download, tnpsc.gov.in and tnpscexams.in).
-- NOT ON SITE: live sitemap checked this run, no RGCB article and no TNPSC Group II prelims article; slugs confirmed absent. RGCB surfaced in this run's searches after earlier runs missed it; notification is dated 28 October 2026.
